These files are the "assistant" preset of ZeroTTS (huggingface.co/zeroweight-ai/ZeroTTS)
converted for its native ggml runtime by the zerotts Python package
(github.com/zeroweight-ai/ZeroTTS: src/zerotts/quant_presets.py,
src/zerotts/gguf_convert.py), with weights stored at reduced precision or
quantized as the preset's recipe says:

  text_encoder=int4 prefix_step=int4 local_frame_decode=int8 block=32 sym acc=4 keep_fp32=/lm_head/MatMul emb=fp16 shared

