ggml/model.gguf contains a converted copy of the weights of
MOSS-Audio-Tokenizer-Nano's decoder: the codebooks, out-projections and
transformer blocks read out of its decode_step graph, repacked as GGUF tensors
and possibly stored at reduced precision or quantized. This converted decoder
is a modified form of MOSS-Audio-Tokenizer-Nano and remains under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The encoder is not included.

  Upstream: https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Audio-Tokenizer
            https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Audio-Tokenizer-Nano-ONNX
